agraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher, which runs on the tracker’s worker like any other."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.sessions(), .vendorIdentifier()])"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing carries the identifier until the app adds this enricher, and the app owns that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decision, the user’s consent to it included. The identifier is read once, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIDevice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WKInterfaceDevice"},{"type":"text","text":" on the main actor, when this is called, and held in the enricher’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"memory only: neither the tracker nor its store writes it to disk (a store keeps no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record’s context). Where the system has none (macOS, Linux, a device not yet unlocked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since it restarted) the enricher sets nothing; it never makes one up."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/standardcontext\/trackers\/enricher\/vendoridentifier()"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Trackers","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Trackers\/Enricher"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://StandardContext/documentation/StandardContext/Trackers/Enricher":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Enricher","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Enricher"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier"